	(text "Add an LDO after the 5v supply to power the ADC from a clean source.\nAdd an LDO to convert from 5v to 3.3 & 1.2 for the MCU."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 21.082 29.972 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "11903517-8f41-4af9-9233-136b4da83185")
	)
	(text "Vref = 0.6v\nVref = 7*[10/10+107] = 0.598v"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 122.174 75.438 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "21ec9b7a-7c3e-4ac5-9200-14d776a782d7")
	)
	(text "18k means it will operate\nthe power-good function is\nselected and the FSS (freq.\nspread spectrum) feature is\nused."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 73.406 77.978 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "34d43968-521a-4c3d-8cff-26492847e025")
	)
	(text "Convert the 12v to 5v then use the other converter to convert to -5v.\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 49.022 100.076 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "3b8f3389-6076-44a1-87de-7c772d4e9f29")
	)
	(text "VDD is supplied from an internal 1.2v regulator\nstepping down from VDDIO but nonetheless its pins\nneed to be decoupled."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 19.05 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "4e281497-f7b7-437c-9d57-fe9fcf902162")
	)
	(text "To produce a swing of 3.3v the maximum\ncurrent sourced from the opamp would be\n8 mA (Rl = 3.3 / 0.008 = 400 Ohm approx.)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 233.68 103.886 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "763dc139-6c24-4d34-80d1-90b1aeddd7c9")
	)
	(text "Ven = 12*[2/(2+3)] = 4.8v\nRising enable threshold = 1.22v\nMaximum is 6v (thus not tied to 12v)\nCould be left floating but is tied to\nprevent being affected by noise."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 34.798 77.978 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "a423825a-b72e-4362-9f04-af32bbcbf68d")
	)
	(text "These decoupling capacitor values\nwere recommended by the datasheet"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 199.898 147.574 0)
